  "name": "CalCOFI Temperature, Salinity and Nutrient Profiles (US-California)",
  "description": "Water column profiles from water bottles, C/STD measurements CALCOFI (California Current Region), coastal California, ex: 28-29N Lat, 114-115W long Publication Data reports - Physical and Chemical Data, CALCOFI Cruise 6901, 7-30 January 1969 and CALCOFI cruise 6902, January 11- March 1969 (SIO Reference 76-14, Sept 1976 (313006) NOAA/WDCA 139.8 D-72:1976 Sep. Data Distribution Available as individual data sets or as part of the NODC Oceanographic Station Profile Time Series CD ROM (CALCOFI 1 & 2). Also included in WOA 1994 URL -- ( http://www.nodc.noaa.gov/General/CDR-detdesc/time-series.html ) [ A TCODE project ]\n\nDeposited content: descriptive metadata only; underlying research data are not included.",
